Once you're all set up, the next step is to deposit some national currency into your account using one of the many payment systems available on the platform. You can even use your Web3 wallet if that's more your style! After you deposit, you're ready to buy some cryptocurrency. You can place an order or use WhiteBIT's currency exchange to make your purchase.

